# Operator-local configuration — config.example.yaml is the committed schema.
/config/config.yaml
# The operator's local credential files, at the repo root only. The leading
# slash matters: unanchored, `secrets/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth and would silently swallow internal/secrets — the package, not a
# credential — leaving it out of every commit.
/secrets/

